              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gichea ghoah gadiyeeda orjooga dooshta Merari aba jeeda gadiyeeda nyaawa sean aba jeeda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, nea ghoahaaghwa saawa Itamari was orjeeda Haruni was ashoohoocheanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.33"
            ]
